  {
    "id": 2003003010110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "トロッコのシーン、すごかったねー！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030030010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ボロボロなのにびゅーんって速くて、\r\nぶつかりそうになったらガシャンって線路を変えて……！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしも操縦してみたくなっちゃった！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるのトロッコは普通のやつの倍速そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もっちろん！\r\nでも安全運転も忘れないよー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あのシーンみたいに、かっこよくテーマソングを\r\n流してもらいながら走るんだーっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうかぁ、確かに\r\n主題歌良かったもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ！　わたし、あの曲大好きになったもん！\r\n特にね、歌詞がすっごく素敵だなって",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『冒険に出かけよう』\r\n『大空の遥か、どこまでも』",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『瞬く間を抱きしめて』\r\n『いつまでもいつまでも君と一緒に』……",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへー\r\nこの部分がね、好きだなーって感じがしたの",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかるよ\r\nあの歌があそこで流れたのはすごく感動的だった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "！　だよねだよねっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーも一緒なんだ！？\r\n……えへへ、嬉しいなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ふふっ……──わぁ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、見て！\r\nあのぬいぐるみ、さっきの映画の！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　ああほんとだ。クレーンゲームか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "いいなぁ……！　ふかっとしてて可愛い……！\r\n上手く取れたら、喜んでくれるかなぁ……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日来るはずだった友達か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん。もともと原作が好きな子でね、キャラクターにも\r\n思い入れがあるって言ってたから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "こういうの取って帰れたら、\r\nお見舞いにもいいかなーって思ったんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "んー……！　でも時間……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "う～～ん……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──っダメだよね！　もう帰らなきゃ……！\r\nアイドルだもん、夜遊びはいけないよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……でも、ぬいぐるみ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010310,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ねぇプロデューサー、映画は今日が最終日だったけど……\r\nこのぬいぐるみ、次のお休みまで残ってると思う？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだなぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（次の休みは……だいぶ先のはずだ\r\nでも夜遊びさせるわけにはいかないし……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010320,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010320"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010330,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……ん",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010340,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やっぱり、大丈夫！\r\n次来た時に狙ってみるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010350,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、今日は帰ろう！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……本当は、やりたいんだろうな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いや、最後に寄っていこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010360,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010360"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ただし、完全に日が沈むまでがリミットだ\r\nそれでもいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010370,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──うん！　十分だよ！\r\nありがとうプロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010370"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010380,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "よーし！　わたし、頑張るよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010380"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003003010390,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……でも、失敗したらプロデューサーに\r\nバトンタッチするから、その時はよろしくね！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300301/2003003010390"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]